          "text": " khurakikhira mu siise sie libatiisia lia Yoana khukhwola khu ndaalo niyo Yesu abukulilwamo khukhwama khwifwe khuniina mwikulu. Mulala khu bano khukhwola abe omuloli alala ne nafwe khu lilamukha liewe.”",
